  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation (config_005, 0.650 accuracy) outperform singleprofile and other encoders. This experiment tests adding image data (resnet50) to this strong RNA-only baseline using concat fusion, isolating the effect of multimodal integration. It balances exploitation of the RNA multiprofile success with exploration of image modality's potential benefit, addressing key uncertainty about multimodal interactions without changing multiple design choices."
}

